    {
     "text": "Implicit differentiation: differentiate both sides with respect to x; every y-term gets a factor y′.",
     "latex": "\\dfrac{d}{dx}y^n=ny^{n-1}y\\prime"
    },
    {
     "text": "Differentiate (product rule on xy).",
     "latex": "2x+y+xy\\prime+2yy\\prime=0"
    },
    {
     "text": "Collect y′.",
     "latex": "y\\prime(x+2y)=-(2x+y)"
